{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116918","id":3340318045,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HGTVd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116918","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116918.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116918.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116918","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116918/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116918/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116918/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ea2a7450b54b60c7a47b6607a519d68ee376f272","number":116918,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"SCons: Write CACHEDIR.TAG to bin/ directory","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://bford.info/cachedir/ describes a convention for marking directories as containing only cached data that can easily be recreated and should not be backed up.\r\n\r\nA number of backup tools, such as borg, support excluding any directories containing this tag from the backup. For those who develop Godot and use such a backup tool, it would be useful to mark the bin/ directory, which (by default) contains all built binary files, as a cache directory, so that its large, often-changing, not-valuable contents are not backed up.\r\n\r\nA number of build tools, including ccache, uv, and cargo, create this tag file in cache directories. In fact, SCons is one such tool: its CacheDir component writes CACHEDIR.TAG. If Godot is built with cache_path set, this path will have an appropriate CACHEDIR.TAG file. But this does not apply to the bin/ directory.\r\n\r\nWrite CACHEDIR.TAG to the bin/ directory early in the build.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"h